#38801
Thief Q --> UD Pimp Teeth~
   So the Samserian Guild sends their finest eh?  This city can be rough and
not for the faint of heart.  That is your first and last warning!  If you're
looking to prove yourself down here, you'll need a fast pair of feet and a set
of nimble hands.  Now, let's get down to business.  Around the Slaver's Route
district you will find a whore house.  Inside resides a man with some amount of
wealth.  Unfortunately, for him, if you should succeed, he has spent the
majority of it on a set of gold teeth.  Bring his "grill" back to me young
rogue.    
~
Travel to the Slaver's district and mug the pimp for his set of gold teeth.  

~
