#38820
Quest to retrieve thief guild scroll~
A very skillfull, and lucky, thief has stolen something very valuable from
my possession: an ancient scroll containing the greatest secrets of our guild. 
He is most likely planning on selling it to the highest bidder. It puts all our guild
at risk, and even worse it puts my head on the chopping block. I can't ask for any
official help in retrieving the scroll because if I do, my life is forfeit for
losing it. If you are willing to help me, I will let you know one of our guild's
greatest secrets. But first you must return the scroll to me. The last I heard
about the thief he was trying to steal from King Snurr but was caught. You
will need to sneak into the Black Tower and find this thief. But be warned,
if the thief discovers you are after the scroll he will destroy it rather than turn
it over, so stealth is the key.
~
Use stealth to infiltrate the Black Tower and
recover the scroll containing the Thief
guild's greatest secrets without being caught.
~
