one of our guild's greatest secrets. Go to our guildmaster
and say the words 'tirok nuthm' and she will know I have
given you my recommendation for entrance.
~
#38821
Quest for Th dagger part 1: UD head thief head and dagger~
You must show a lot of promise indeed for the girl you call
the Queen of Thieves to show you this place. I am not as
easily impressed. I might have something for you, but first
you'll have to do some things for me. I have been here for eons
and sending gnats like you running around is one of the few
entertainments left to me.

The first task is to bring me the jewelled dagger and the head
of the leader of the thieve's guild in the Under Dark. He once
insulted me, and since I am not allowed to have revenge on this
guild of thieves it will provide me some pleasure to take it out
on your underground cousins.
~
Bring the head and jewelled dagger from the leader of
the Under Dark thieve's guild to the god of mischief.
~
45 60 142614488 60 30 30
G 38814
P 38820
O MOB 20688
O OBJ 20671
R SPELL 128
An ancient, forgotten god of mischief gives a knowing glance to the bloodstains
on your clothes and calmly tosses the bloody head into the corner where you
notice an enormous pile of other skulls for the first time. You wonder how many
people have died at the whim of this god and hope to not be one of those victims
yourself. An ancient, forgotten god of mischief says, 'Come back when you are
able and we shall have some more fun' and gives you a gleeful smile that makes
you happy to hurry from the room.
~
#38822
Quest for Th dagger part 2: Dagger of Lies from Loki~
The ancient, forgotten god of mischief looks at you as you
approach. He says, 'I knew you would be back. Few are 
those that can resist the rewards I offer. And fewer still
are those that survive my challenges.

For your next adventure I want you to hunt down the upstart
who calls himself Loki. He calls himself a god of mischief
and a prankster, but he is just a young pup who is only a few 
millennia old. Teach him a lesson by taking his Dagger of Lies
from him. 
~
Aquire the Dagger of Lies from Loki by any means
and return it to the wizened figure in your
guild hall.
~
