#38823
Quest for Th dagger part 3: Prism of bending and head of Lord Mourning, the 6th Pirate Lord~
The ancient figure chained here seems to be waiting for
you as you enter the room. 'I have another task for you. Around
the ocean exist a group of pirates that call themselves the Pirate
Lords. One of them stole something of value to me, and I want
it back. Find the secret 6th Pirate Lord. Bring me his head and
the jewel he holds.'
~
Find the 6th Pirate Lord of the high seas. Cut off his
head and return the head and the prism of bending
to the ancient god captive in the thief guild.
~
