#38824
Quest for Th dagger part 4: Dagger of Vengeance and head from Hiddukel in Abyss~
You think twice about what you are doing as you reenter the secret
room in the guild. You were told this figure was an ancient god. Yet
he remains chained in this room. There is definitely something different
about the figure, but you begin to wonder if he can truly give you an 
item of value like he led you to believe. You begin to wonder what his
exact words really were.

'Ah, back again so soon! You must be eager indeed for the next task.
In the bottom of the dark Abyss resides a demon thief named Hiddukel,
the Prince of Lies. You will need to bring me his dagger, and his head
of course.'
~
~
